    </articleDate>
    <articleIntersectDescription>
      <Value><![CDATA[For the second time, a site laboratory has been accredited in South Africa. Here's how the N2 Nqadu team made it happen.]]></Value>
    </articleIntersectDescription>
    <articleIntersectImage>
      <Value><![CDATA[umb://media/8f288b1d3dd5425ca671764e2a160eb8]]></Value>
    </articleIntersectImage>
